## Why This Question Is Asked
Tests the ability to translate feature ideas into a privacy-conscious cost-benefit analysis with concrete metrics, edge/cloud trade-offs, and rollout risks.

## Key Concepts
- Local aggregation, data minimization, privacy-by-design
- Edge/cloud trade-offs, offline fallback, consent UX
- Rollout sequencing, drift detection, break-even analysis

## Code Example
```javascript
function updateHistogram(hist, value, scale) {
  const bucket = Math.min(Math.floor(value * scale), hist.length - 1);
  hist[bucket] = (hist[bucket] || 0) + 1;
}

function serializeForSync(hist) {
  return hist.filter(count => count > 0);
}
